// Title: IE Change Domain Zone
// Rule ID: 45e112d0-7759-4c2a-aa36-9f8fb79d3393
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1137
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_change_security_zones.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
// Sigma rules: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma
